				<description>&lt;p&gt;In this section, we lists some audio projects. Find their decriptions using the navigation menu.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A general list of audio resources - &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YTU1e2CIeUXqsu06z_pfugpt3lkMeXeZLbLauOtksCQ/edit#gid=556879388&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sanskrit, Hindu, Hindi and Kannada Podcast list &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KMhtMaHCQpucqxH3aVcmYmPvQyV9vmunvckV2ARvD4M/edit#gid=0&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Technical tips &lt;a href=&#34;https://sanskrit-coders.github.io/site/pages/content/audio.html#podcasts&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
